#02 >take a calling has four parts
placed: 2026-10-17
issue: "Who is allowed to answer" and "who does it" are often different hands. Approve: you answer, compute renames, compute checks.
recommend: I think we should >take. Every act names four things: who answers, who does, who checks, and what is given first. An act with no calling is not run; the clerk kicks it back.
